    "title": "Tampa Home Prices Are In Trouble - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Douglas McIntyre ,\n1 days ago In July, national home prices rose, according to research firm Case-Shiller. They also rose in most of the 20 cities covered by the research. However, in Tampa, they were down sharply year over year. The reason is probably the destruction and insurance rates that recent hurricanes have triggered. Douglas A. McIntyre, Editor-In-Chief of Climatecrisis247, discusses. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 5",
